1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,422
Day 18, before dawn.

2
00:00:02,422 --> 00:00:08,746
With U.S. cooperation, Israel struck several senior Iranian officials at once.

3
00:00:08,746 --> 00:00:19,529
At 5:12 AM, Iranian state TV confirmed the deaths of former parliament speaker Ali Larijani and Basij commander Gholamreza Soleimani.

4
00:00:19,529 --> 00:00:24,232
The oldest channel in Iran's nuclear diplomacy had closed.

